WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.600
Let’s walk through Work the assigned queue.

00:00:02.600 --> 00:00:05.138
On this slide, work the Macro queue in order

00:00:05.138 --> 00:00:09.250
and inspect the generated output alongside its evidence before recording

00:00:09.250 --> 00:00:10.887
a specialist decision.

00:00:10.887 --> 00:00:14.662
In practice, macro is the first specialist boundary.

00:00:14.662 --> 00:00:18.837
A finalized or explicitly skipped Macro review unlocks the downstream

00:00:18.837 --> 00:00:19.675
seats.

00:00:19.675 --> 00:00:22.225
When you are ready, use Open assigned queue to

00:00:22.225 --> 00:00:23.975
move to the live surface.

00:00:23.975 --> 00:00:26.725
The guide will not make the workflow decision for you

00:00:26.725 --> 00:00:26.875
.
